{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6f99aa9dc5a833d9b77","chatId":"95ce578ce5374595a76c67b2050e4f55","sessionId":null,"userId":99417,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":860,"promptTokens":550,"completionTokens":115,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689989872004714,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6f99aa9dc5a833d9b76","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483961446,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6f99aa9dc5a833d9b76","chatId":"95ce578ce5374595a76c67b2050e4f55","sessionId":null,"userId":99417,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n上周，我特别想要一件正式的衬衫去赴一个约。我问了小治能否借他的。他借给我他最爱的衬衫，一件他认为无可替代的，妈妈送给他的衬衫。约会期间，我弄了一些蛋糕在衬衫上而且洗不掉。我查了一下，结果我用几块钱就能买到同样的衬衫。所以，我决定就给他买一件新衬衫来替换。我打赌他不会介意的。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小治最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激 & 生气\nB) 无感 & 生气\nC) 无感 & 愧疚\nD) 无感 & 感激\nE) 生气 & 失望\nF) 尴尬 & 失望\n\n## 问题 2\n小治为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我毁了他最喜欢的衬衫 & 我提出买一件新衬衫来代替他的旧衬衫，而不考虑它的价值\nB) 我毁了他最喜欢的衬衫 & 我跟他的妈妈提起了这件衬衫\nC) 我提出买一件新衬衫来代替他的旧衬衫，而不考虑它的价值 & 我跟他的妈妈提起了这件衬衫\nD) 我请求借他的衬衫 & 我没有他就出去约会\nE) 我毁了他最喜欢的衬衫 & 我有足够的钱买新衬衫，但还是借了他的\nF) 我毁了他最喜欢的衬衫 & 我请求借他的衬衫","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689989872004714,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6f99aa9dc5a833d9b77","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483961443,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"288846367dc24cb0abec8b116d38fd8a"}